  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformative Growth of the Care Economy in T&#xfc;rkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the coordination of the UN Resident Coordinator, the ILO will lead the UN Joint Programme (UNJP) and implement it in collaboration with UNDP. The implementing agencies will cooperate with UN Women, UNICEF, and UNFPA. The Joint Program has two interlink outputs:1.	Development of care economy and service provision models ready-for-implementation and endorsed by central and local actors, including those harnessing the potentials of digital transformation (Implemented by UNDP)2.	Increased capacity among the government institutions and social partners to develop, implement and monitor a road map on improvement of policies and financing strategy of care economy in T&#xfc;rkiye. (Implemented by ILO)</narrative>
  </description>
